{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n昨晚（2日）陳柏宇太太符曉薇（Leanne）帶女兒Abi到尼泊爾挑戰極限，竟遇上懸崖鞦韆！有畏高症的Leanne嚇到花容失色，女兒卻堅持要玩，Leanne更越洋致電老公陳柏宇求救，惜阻止失敗。最終Leanne被逼上陣，場面極度驚險，她能否成功克服恐懼？\n</p>\n<h2>符曉薇直擊懸崖鞦韆嚇破膽 「我唔夠膽呀」</h2>\n<p>今集Leanne為填補行程空缺，原打算帶女兒Abi到山頂玩鞦韆，享受寫意時光。豈料抵達後才發現事與願違，Leanne驚見鞦韆竟設在懸崖邊，與她想像中完全不一樣，嚇得她立即卻步：「諗住畀佢 swing 下，點知一過到嚟，見到副鞦韆喺懸崖邊，同我幻想完全唔一樣，佢而家死𠼱要玩，我唔夠膽呀。好驚呀，我有畏高㗎。」面對女兒的堅持，有畏高症的Leanne陷入兩難，場面一度僵持。</p>\n<h2>陳柏宇越洋視像急阻止 「危險呀！」</h2>\n<p>在女兒Abi的強烈要求下，手足無措的Leanne唯有使出最後一招，越洋視像致電遠在香港的老公陳柏宇求救。起初Abi還信心滿滿地表示：「爸爸梗畀我玩㗎」，以為爸爸會站在自己一方。沒想到陳柏宇看到現場環境後，也認為太過危險，透過視像果斷回覆：「唔好喇，危險呀！」他解釋因為無法親身衡量鞦韆的安全程度，所以不建議女兒冒險。可惜，連老公的出面阻止也未能勸退女兒。</p>\n<h2>囡囡Abi一哭二鬧得逞 符曉薇尖叫陪玩再戰玻璃橋</h2>\n<p>願望落空的Abi隨即發揮港女本色，使出「一哭二鬧」神功，最終成功爭取到由畏高的母親陪同下一齊玩。可憐的Leanne被逼坐上懸崖鞦韆，全程嚇得緊閉雙眼，尖叫聲響徹山谷。挑戰完鞦韆，Abi意猶未盡，再要求媽咪陪她挑戰橫跨千呎深谷的玻璃橋。Leanne再度挑戰極限，首次嘗試時行不到一步便驚慌回頭，再度上橋時更全程不敢向下望，最終仍不敵內心恐懼，頭暈腳軟下直接癱坐在橋面上。相反，大膽的Abi則玩得不亦樂乎，在橋上興奮地跑來跑去。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚母愛偉大 「睇到都腳軟」</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，網民對Leanne的偉大母愛表示佩服，但亦對驚險畫面感到震驚。不少網民留言指：「Leanne好偉大，為個女真係豁出去！」、「個鞦韆喺懸崖邊，睇到相都腳軟，唔敢想像點玩！」、「Abi膽生毛，Leanne就嚇到面青，個反差好好笑！」、「完全明白Leanne，有畏高嘅人真係一步都行唔到，癱喺度好正常！」、「陳柏宇想救都救唔到，笑死！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1_9977236186ae9803bb4391.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1_9977236186ae9803bb4391.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/5_3768238706ae98058ceacf.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/5_3768238706ae98058ceacf.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/6_18920723326ae9806a03bc3.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/6_18920723326ae9806a03bc3.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/7_16443584196ae98074e25e6.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/7_16443584196ae98074e25e6.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/8_9896490666ae9807ece5d2.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/8_9896490666ae9807ece5d2.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9_7500478766ae9808435fff.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9_7500478766ae9808435fff.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2069746686ae9808b694a8.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2069746686ae9808b694a8.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_3193710066ae98093b6b8f.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_3193710066ae98093b6b8f.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_17823207956ae9809f6d8af.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_17823207956ae9809f6d8af.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_11054727366ae980a6a5fef.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_11054727366ae980a6a5fef.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:36.763754+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1281,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:00:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:59:05.989018+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:19:05.224871+00:00","content_hash":"dbdb260bf43a5534749a97bd8481fcf1595f4b8dd3f12a6eaeec39365a766e1e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}